; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M5: Hump trailing (TrailMode 13), setup 4 of 4: sell, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter M15 EMA 100, target 3R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: stop beyond the last completed pullback hump, once the profit reaches 0.5R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 13, TrailParam 0).
; Same setup as Loma_T15_Gold_M5_Hump_4of4_Sell_0700-2000_M15 in Loma_XAUUSD_v1_35.zip (only the magic number and the trade comment differ): run one or the other, not both. Its Loma_T15 header gives the one-minute backtest's figures; the replay's are here.
; Picked on 1 Jan 2025 - 15 May 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.34): 104 trades, PF 1.78. Replay of the same months: 97 trades, PF 1.50.
; TICK REPLAY (every Dukascopy tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: VT's 0.15 spread scaled by Dukascopy's own spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce). 16 May - 13 Nov 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 55 trades, PF 1.67, net +18.9R (stressed PF 1.29); the 4 setups of M5 + Hump together 141 trades, PF 1.27, net +20.7R (stressed 1.10).
; Hump trailing with its own setups was chosen as the best on M5 (highest PF of the EA's trailing systems with 100+ trades in those months; each system has its own setups), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 28 trades, PF 0.38. The 4 setups together: 15 Jul - 31 Dec 2024, 116 trades, PF 0.69. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Needs a spread near VT's 0.15 USD: at Dukascopy's own wider spreads the 4 setups took 94 of the 141 trades in those months, PF 1.37.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
